sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.attendance.check-out)"
    participant Controller as "Employee AttendanceController"
    participant Model as "Attendance Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Isi form lalu klik Check-out
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/attendance/check-out/{id}
    Controller->>Model: getById(id) + validasi kepemilikan
    Model->>DB: SELECT attendance by id
    DB-->>Model: Data sesi absensi aktif

    alt Data valid (status present, belum checkout, aturan valid)
        Controller->>Model: Proses checkOut(id, data)
        Model->>DB: UPDATE attendance SET check_out, early_leave, photo
        DB-->>Model: Update success
        Model-->>Controller: Check-out berhasil
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success/warning
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi check-out berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (id tidak ada/bukan pemilik/sudah checkout/validasi gagal)
        Controller->>View: Back/redirect + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal check-out
    end
